; An invalid line continuing a directive is a syntax error inside it, which
; drops the whole directive: no unbalanced transaction is reported, and the
; account whose open is dropped is unknown. After a blank line it continues
; nothing.
2020-01-01 open Assets:A
2020-01-01 open Assets:B
2020-01-01 open Assets:C
  garbage
2020-01-01 open Assets:D

  garbage

2020-01-02 * "x"
  Assets:A  1 USD
  garbage
  Assets:B  -1 USD

2020-01-03 * "y"
  Assets:A  1 USD
  Assets:B  -1 USD
  ; a comment
  garbage

2020-01-04 * "z"
  Assets:C  1 USD
  Assets:D  -1 USD
